// ==UserScript==
// @name         Bilibili Blocked Users Exporter
// @namespace    https://github.com/BobbyWibowo
// @version      0.1.1
// @description  Export your Bilibili blocked-user list with follower counts, profile URLs, a CSV file, and a console table.
// @author       Bobby Wibowo
